---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Andy Araya"
  description="Terms of Service for Andy Araya's personal website and related personal applications."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="noise-layer pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-35"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-cyan-200/70">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-white/72">
        <p>Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service apply to Andy Araya's personal website and related personal applications. By using the website
          or any related application, you agree to use them responsibly and in accordance with these terms.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Use Of The Site</h2>
        <p>
          This website is provided for informational and personal portfolio purposes. You may view and use the content for lawful,
          non-abusive purposes. You may not attempt to disrupt, misuse, reverse engineer, or compromise the website or its infrastructure.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Personal Applications</h2>
        <p>
          Andy Job Search Assistant is a personal application intended to help Andy Araya organize job-search related email activity,
          including job applications, recruiter conversations, interview scheduling, reminders, and follow-ups. Any related personal
          application is provided as-is for its intended purpose. Access may be changed, limited, or discontinued at any time without notice.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">No Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The website and related applications are provided on an as-is and as-available basis. No warranty is made that the site
          will always be available, secure, error-free, or suitable for every purpose.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Limitation Of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Andy Araya is not liable for damages or losses resulting from the use of,
          or inability to use, this website or related personal applications.
        </p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these Terms of Service can be sent to
          <a class="text-cyan-200 transition hover:text-white" href="mailto:andyarayacr@gmail.com">andyarayacr@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
